# Only the icon needs to be IN the package -- package.json's "icon" field
# requires the file physically present, and vsce hard-errors without it.
# The README's GIF renders on the Marketplace listing via vsce's GitHub
# raw-URL rewriting (confirmed working), not from inside the installed
# package, so shipping it to every installer's machine is pure dead weight.
images/*.gif
